{"record": "decision", "id": "D-crm-activities-organ-002", "ts": "2026-11-11T15:29:52.820Z", "agent": "product-engineer", "slice_id": "crm-activities-organ", "branch": "feat/crm-activities-organ", "product": "seed", "tier": "escalate", "class": "other", "criteria_hit": ["C4", "C9"], "reversibility": "needs_migration", "blast_radius": "seed_internal", "surprise_test": "all_no", "paths": ["seed/lib/backend/noctusai_lib/domain/activities/sql.py"], "decision": "We will write act_events by hand inside the organ because the E1 transition_log primitive is not on dev; marked NOC-REMEDIATE[transition-log-primitive], same event names so the swap is mechanical."}
{"record": "decision", "id": "D-crm-activities-organ-003", "ts": "2026-11-11T15:30:06.107Z", "agent": "product-engineer", "slice_id": "crm-activities-organ", "branch": "feat/crm-activities-organ", "product": "seed", "tier": "escalate", "class": "other", "criteria_hit": ["C3"], "reversibility": "shared_code", "blast_radius": "seed_api", "surprise_test": "all_no", "paths": ["seed/lib/backend/noctusai_lib/domain/pipeline/presets.py", "seed/lib/backend/noctusai_lib/domain/pipeline/market_presets.py"], "decision": "We will add CrmPreset.activity_types (default empty, additive) and put the real-estate types in the existing market_presets.py, which already carries its own NOC-REMEDIATE to move to the canon."}
{"record": "decision", "id": "D-crm-activities-organ-004", "ts": "2026-11-11T15:30:07.005Z", "agent": "product-engineer", "slice_id": "crm-activities-organ", "branch": "feat/crm-activities-organ", "product": "seed", "tier": "notify", "class": "edge_case", "criteria_hit": ["C1"], "reversibility": "one_commit", "blast_radius": "slice_paths", "surprise_test": "all_no", "paths": ["seed/lib/backend/noctusai_lib/domain/activities/sql.py"], "decision": "We will make a repeated intent that changes nothing (complete a done task, reassign to the same user) answer replayed and append no event; a closed activity refuses edits with 409."}
